{"xson":[{"/iati-activities/iati-activity":[{"/activity-date":[{"@iso-date":"2008-09-11","@type":"2"},{"@iso-date":"2016-09-30","@type":"4"}],"/activity-status@code":"4","/collaboration-type@code":"2","/contact-info":[{"/department/narrative":[{"1":"WCA","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/email":[{"1":"r.omar@ifad.org"}],"/job-title/narrative":[{"1":"Head of Hub/ Country Director","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/organisation/narrative":[{"1":"International Fund for Agricultural Development","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/person-name/narrative":[{"1":"Omar, Rasha","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/telephone":[{"1":"+390654591"}],"/website":[{"1":"http://www.ifad.org"}],"@type":"1"}],"/default-aid-type":[{"@code":"C01","@vocabulary":"1"}],"/default-tied-status@code":"5","/description":[{"/narrative":[{"1":"Key project objectivesThe project's overall development goal is to improve the incomes and livelihoods of farm families in the groundnut basin sustainably, by integrating them into profitable value chains based on local agroecological potential. The specific objectives are to help: (i) smallholders, including highly vulnerable people, women and young people, to develop profitable economic activities through direct contracting between their producers' organizations and market operators in selected value chains; and (ii) all actors in the value chains to play an active role in dialogue at the regional and national levels and thereby obtain easier access to markets and a more equitable distribution of profits.Policy and institutional objectivesThe project will strengthen the capacity of small-scale producers, especially the most vulnerable producers, to participate actively in developing value chains. Major emphasis is given to strengthening the capabilities of producers' organizations to increase their influence on development processes and progressively widen the range of services they can provide to their members through new and effective forms of partnerships. By fostering representative inter-professional organizations, the project will help smallholder producers have a greater voice in decision-making and policymaking at the regional and national levels.","@xml:lang":"EN"}]}],"/document-link":[{"/category":[{"@code":"A12"}],"/description/narrative":[{"1":"More information on how IFAD publish IATI data to ensure the effectiveness of development.","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/language":[{"@code":"EN"}],"/title/narrative":[{"1":"IATI documentation on IFAD corporate website","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"@format":"TEXT/HTML","@url":"/en/iati"},{"/category":[{"@code":"A12"}],"/description/narrative":[{"1":"The IFAD website includes a specific page for this project.  More information can be found here.","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/language":[{"@code":"EN"}],"/title/narrative":[{"1":"Project page on IFAD corporate website","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"@format":"TEXT/HTML","@url":"/w/projects/1414"}],"/iati-identifier":"XM-DAC-41108-1100001414","/location":[{"/description/narrative":[{"1":"This point represents the centroid of the project area. For more detailed geographic information, please refer to the project page on the IFAD website.","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/exactness@code":"1","/location-reach@code":"1","/name/narrative":[{"1":"Agricultural Development: Agricultural Value Chains Support Project","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/point/pos":"14.203832441557225 -15.762957130325741","/point@srsName":"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/4326"}],"/other-identifier":[{"@ref":"1100001414","@type":"A1"}],"/participating-org":[{"/narrative":[{"1":"International Fund for Agricultural Development","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"@activity-id":"XM-DAC-41108-1100001414","@ref":"XM-DAC-41108","@role":"1","@type":"40"}],"/recipient-country":[{"@code":"SN","@percentage":100}],"/reporting-org/narrative":[{"1":"International Fund for Agricultural Development","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/reporting-org@ref":"XM-DAC-41108","/reporting-org@type":"40","/sector":[{"@code":"311","@percentage":100,"@vocabulary":"2"}],"/title/narrative":[{"1":"Agricultural Developm